f:["$","$L17",null,{"toc":[{"depth":2,"url":"#the-mechanism-precisely","title":"The mechanism, precisely"},{"depth":2,"url":"#the-guarantee-with-its-qualifiers-intact","title":"The guarantee, with its qualifiers intact"},{"depth":2,"url":"#what-is-pinned-and-what-is-not","title":"What is pinned, and what is not"},{"depth":2,"url":"#coverage","title":"Coverage"},{"depth":2,"url":"#why-nix-specifically","title":"Why Nix, specifically"},{"depth":2,"url":"#when-it-is-worth-it","title":"When it is worth it"},{"depth":2,"url":"#where-the-exact-truth-lives","title":"Where the exact truth lives"},{"depth":2,"url":"#common-questions","title":"Common questions"}],"full":"$undefined","children":[["$","$L18",null,{"children":"Local Remote Execution"}],["$","$L19",null,{"children":"What LRE actually is: a way to make your local toolchain and your remote workers the same toolchain, so both sides share one cache."}],["$","$L1a",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Who this is for:"}]," anyone deciding whether LRE is worth adopting, and\nanyone who has read about it and formed the wrong model of what it does.\n",["$","strong",null,{"children":"What you'll have at the end:"}]," the actual mechanism, the guarantee it makes\nand its exact qualifiers, and what it does not cover. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Time:"}]," fifteen\nminutes."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Local Remote Execution is a way of building your toolchain with Nix such that\n",["$","strong",null,{"children":"the exact same toolchain binaries are used by your local build and by your\nremote workers"}],". Because the toolchain is part of every action's digest, the\ntwo sides then produce identical action digests, and a cache entry written\nby one is a cache hit for the other."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["That is the whole idea. It is worth stating what it is ",["$","em",null,{"children":"not"}],", because the\nname invites a different reading."]}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"className":"my-6 flex gap-3 rounded-xl border px-5 py-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-50/60 text-foreground dark:bg-amber-500/10","role":"alert","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"20","height":"20","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"1.75","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M12 9v4m0 4h.01M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0Z"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1 [&>p]:my-0 [&>p+p]:mt-2","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]","children":"LRE does not mean running a worker on your laptop"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["No local Forge worker exists in this design, and no container runs\non your machine during a build. Your local build is an ordinary local\nBazel build. What LRE changes is ",["$","em",null,{"children":"which compiler that build invokes"}],". The\ntoolchain container images are, in the source's own words, \"never really\ninstantiated\"; they exist to have their environment extracted."]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","$L1b",null,{"as":"h2","id":"the-mechanism-precisely","children":"The mechanism, precisely"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"The trick is absolute paths."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["A Nix-built toolchain lives at a path like\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"/nix/store/<hash>-clang-…/bin/clang"}],", where the hash is derived from every\ninput that produced it. LRE generates Bazel toolchain configurations that\nhardcode those absolute store paths: not ",["$","code",null,{"children":"/usr/bin/cc"}],", not a ",["$","code",null,{"children":"PATH"}]," lookup,\nthe literal store path."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Then it arranges for that exact path to exist on both sides:"}],"\n",["$","$L1c",null,{"children":"graph TD\nnix[\"Nix derivation<br/>/nix/store/&lt;hash&gt;-clang\"]\nnix --> gen[\"Generated Bazel toolchain<br/>hardcodes the store path\"]\nnix --> img[\"Worker image<br/>Env/PATH = the same store paths\"]\nnix --> shell[\"nix develop<br/>realizes the closure locally\"]\ngen --> local[\"Local build<br/>invokes /nix/store/&lt;hash&gt;-clang\"]\ngen --> remote[\"Remote action<br/>invokes /nix/store/&lt;hash&gt;-clang\"]\nshell --> local\nimg --> remote\nlocal --> same[\"Same digest → one shared cache\"]\nremote --> same\n"}],"\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c"]}],"$L3d"]}]
